Movie Quote API Load Testing

This project demonstrates how to perform API performance testing using Artillery on a Node.js + Express backend.
The goal is to compare the performance of:

An unpaginated endpoint returning 1,000 movie quotes
A paginated endpoint returning 20 quotes per request
A POST endpoint for saving favorite quotes

The assignment focuses on understanding:

Load testing fundamentals
Pagination performance benefits
Response time metrics (median & p95)
Throughput and concurrency
Detecting implementation/performance issues under load
