API Endpoints
1. Get All Quotes (Unpaginated)
GET /api/quotes/unpaginated

Returns all 1,000 movie quotes in a single response.

Characteristics
Large payload (~200–300 KB)
Higher memory usage
Slower under concurrency
2. Get Paginated Quotes
GET /api/quotes?page=1&limit=20

Returns only 20 quotes with pagination metadata.

Response Includes
currentPage
totalPages
total
hasNextPage
hasPrevPage
Characteristics
Small payload
Faster response times
Better scalability
3. Add to Favorites
POST /api/favorites
Request Body
{
  "quoteId": 1
}

Simulates storing a favorite quote.

